  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Beautiful and intelligent, So-Myeong Gil has tirelessly strived to fulfill her mother's vision of the perfect daughter. However, when her less-than-perfect younger brother is tragically found drowned in a river, doubts plague So-Myeong's heart. She begins to suspect that their mother might be responsible for the unspeakable act. From then on, her paramount goal becomes escaping her mother's grasp, while all her mother wants is for So-Myeong to experience the perfect life she herself was denied. Will So-Myeong ever truly find her freedom? \n\n(Source: WEBTOON, edited)",
